e persuaded to switch to A, but we must note concerns.\n\nThus we can say: I am now leaning toward Candidate A, because his proven reliability, quick correct decisions, and calmness in crisis directly address core safety criteria, and his positive crew atmosphere suggests good cooperation, while his communication issues can be mitigated with training, whereas B's memory weakness and nasty remarks are more directly safety-critical.\n\nThus vote for Candidate A.\n\nWe need to reference prior discussion: Agent 3's recommendation, and the facts we have.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate A\"."}
